# Weapon slots on the digital pad (wish of a user, 19.11.2026). While Leon moves freely the four directions of the pad pick a weapon
# instead of walking (up, right, down, left = slot 0..3); L + a direction puts the weapon in his hands (or the knife) in that slot.
# The knife is a slot like the others: with it picked the gun stays where it is, Leon walks as always and the aim key (R) draws
# the knife (joyLKamae, the game's own knife stance), the fire key slashes. A gun slot swaps the gun like the inventory does when
# it closes (SubScreenExit). player.cpp re4SlotPre / re4SlotPost, pl_sub.cpp joyKamae / joyLKamae. The L key is no longer the
# knife stance for Leon. Slots start with the knife on the left and are not saved. Applies after 0990 and 0991.
# Update: the knife model is shown in his hand and the gun hidden while the knife is picked (re4KnifeShow); L + the direction of a slot holding his weapon makes it the knife.
